  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Reinforcing the Monitoring and Reporting Infrastructure</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The project seeks to improve the infrastructure of monitoring and reporting within the Artists-at-Risk-sector in MENA, Africa south of Sahara and Southeast Asia 
The project will with local actors monitore and report violations of artistic rights and artistic freedom. 
The project will improve the standing of artistic rights and artistic freedom, as a part of a larger goal of free expression and democratisation.</narrative>
  </description>
